  "keyFeatures": [
    "OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible API — change one line of code to switch",
    "60+ open-weight models (Llama, Mistral, DeepSeek, Qwen, FLUX, Whisper, and more)",
    "11+ European providers across 8 countries — data never leaves the EU",
    "Intelligent routing with flavors: balanced, speed, price, eco, batch",
    "Per-response environmental impact data (carbon, energy, water, PUE)",
    "Automatic failover across providers for high availability",
    "Batch API for async, high-volume, cost-efficient workloads",
    "Tool calling, vision, structured outputs, and streaming support",
    "GDPR-compliant — no training on customer data"
